    "html": "<div\nalign=\"center\"><center>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"12\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"480\">\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"\n        size=\"4\" face=\"Tahoma\">Forms for League Match Operations:</font></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td valign=\"top\" width=\"240\"><a href=\"SignupForm.pdf\"><font\n        size=\"4\" face=\"Tahoma\"><strong>Match Sign-up Sheet:</strong></font></a></td>\n        <td width=\"240\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\"><strong>Sign\n        up sheet for competitors to request their target and\n        relay for a match.</strong></font></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td valign=\"top\" width=\"240\"><a\n        href=\"ILMOScorecard.pdf\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"Tahoma\"><strong>Match\n        Scorecards:</strong></font></a></td>\n        <td width=\"240\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\"><strong>Scorecards\n        for recording shot values for each competitor. </strong><em><strong>(Printed\n        2 scorecards per page.)</strong></em></font></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td valign=\"top\" width=\"240\"><a href=\"NewShooter.pdf\"><font\n        size=\"4\" face=\"Tahoma\"><strong>New Shooter Info:</strong></font></a></td>\n        <td width=\"240\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\"><strong>Standardized\n        form for collecting information for new team members.</strong></font></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td valign=\"top\" width=\"240\"><a\n        href=\"MidSeasonScorecard.pdf\"><font size=\"4\"\n        face=\"Tahoma\"><strong>League Tournament </strong><em><strong>&quot;900&quot;</strong></em><strong>\n        Scorecards:</strong></font></a></td>\n        <td width=\"240\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\"><strong>Scorecards\n        for use at the 90-shot League Tournaments </strong><em><strong>(i.e.\n        Mid-Season Tournament)</strong></em></font></td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</center></div>",
    "text": "Forms for League Match Operations:\nMatch Sign-up Sheet:\nSign\nup sheet for competitors to request their target and\nrelay for a match.\nMatch\nScorecards:\nScorecards\nfor recording shot values for each competitor. (Printed\n2 scorecards per page.)\nNew Shooter Info:\nStandardized\nform for collecting information for new team members.\nLeague Tournament \"900\"\nScorecards:\nScorecards\nfor use at the 90-shot League Tournaments (i.e.\nMid-Season Tournament)"
